# Generated fixture — deterministic (seed=42) but ~75 MB, an order of
# magnitude larger than the committed fixtures and over GitHub's file-
# size limit. Regenerated by `./do generate-fixtures`; the load path
# auto-regenerates it if missing. See ADR 0021.
data/impressions.json
# Since ADR 0040 the contexts hold the visits of visitors who never buy:
# ~100 k rows, ~37 MB. Generated with the impressions, by the same seed.
data/contexts.json

